---
import LandingLayout from "../../../layouts/LandingLayout.astro";
---

<LandingLayout title="About | Cadenza Studio" description="Built by a teacher, not around one. Learn about Cadenza Studio.">


  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/cadenza" class="nav-logo">
        <img src="/images/cadenza/logo-placeholder.svg" alt="Cadenza Studio Logo">
        Cadenza Studio
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/cadenza/features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/solutions" class="nav-link">Solutions</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/blog" class="nav-link">Blog</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/compare" class="nav-link">Compare</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/about" class="nav-link">About</a>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-cta">
        
        <a href="http://localhost:5173" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
      </div>
      <button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Toggle menu">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="mobile-menu">
    <a href="/cadenza/features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/solutions" class="nav-link">Solutions</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/blog" class="nav-link">Blog</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/compare" class="nav-link">Compare</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/about" class="nav-link">About</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/contact" class="nav-link">Contact</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Built by a teacher, not around one.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our Story</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Cadenza Studio didn't start as a business plan. It started with a teacher running an actual music studio, doing exactly what this page describes: a spreadsheet for billing, a calendar for lessons, and a phone full of text threads with parents who all had the same question at the same time.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Cadenza started as a cloud SaaS, the same as everything else on the Compare page, then got rebuilt from scratch as something teachers could actually own. Scheduling, billing, portals, and the AI that listens to a lesson and drafts the follow-up all run on the teacher's own computer now, not on a server we control. We only ask for a subscription for the one thing that genuinely costs us something to provide: securely connecting one teacher's studio to another's.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Most studio software gets built by people who've never taught a lesson. This one didn't. Every feature exists because it solved a real Tuesday, not because it looked good on a roadmap.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">Today, Cadenza Studio runs the same studio it was built for and is being tested with a small group of other teachers who had the exact same spreadsheet problem.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Values -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="badge">Our Values</div>
        <h2>The principles that guide everything we do.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="feature-card" style="text-align: center;">
          <div class="feature-card-icon" style="margin: 0 auto 1rem;">🎯</div>
          <h4>Teacher-First</h4>
          <p>Built by someone who still teaches, for the parts of teaching that have nothing to do with music.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card" style="text-align: center;">
          <div class="feature-card-icon" style="margin: 0 auto 1rem;">✨</div>
          <h4>Simplicity</h4>
          <p>If it takes a manual, it's not done yet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card" style="text-align: center;">
          <div class="feature-card-icon" style="margin: 0 auto 1rem;">💡</div>
          <h4>Built to Grow</h4>
          <p>Cadenza Studio solves today's problem (scheduling, billing, messaging) and is built on infrastructure designed to take on more of the studio's work over time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Mission -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our Mission</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text);">To give music teachers back the hours spreadsheets and text threads were quietly taking, one studio at a time.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/cadenza/features" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">See what Cadenza Studio can do</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Get in touch</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/blog" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Read our blog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Join our community of music teachers</h2>
      <p>Start using Cadenza Studio today and see the difference it makes.</p>
      <a href="http://localhost:5173" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Get Started Free</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <a href="/cadenza" class="nav-logo">
            <img src="/images/cadenza/logo-placeholder.svg" alt="Cadenza Studio Logo">
            Cadenza Studio
          </a>
          <p>The complete studio management platform for music teachers.</p>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem;"><a href="/curator" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">Built on Curator</a>, open, local-first AI for education.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-column">
          <h4>Product</h4>
          <a href="/cadenza/features">Features</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/pricing">Pricing</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/blog">Blog</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/compare">Compare</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-column">
          <h4>Company</h4>
          <a href="/cadenza/about">About</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-column">
          <h4>Legal</h4>
          <a href="/cadenza/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Cadenza Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/jeremysheeshka/Cadenza-Studio-App" class="social-link" aria-label="GitHub">
